      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">首页 Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; <a href="/provincial-nominee-programs">省提名 Provincial Nominee Programs</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; 安省 OINP</div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Ontario Immigration | 安大略省移民</span>
      <h2>安省省提名<br>Ontario Immigrant Nominee Program</h2>
      <div class="hero-intro">
        <p>Ontario Immigrant Nominee Program（OINP，安省省提名计划）根据安省经济与劳动力需求，提名符合条件的申请人申请加拿大永久居民。省提名获批后，永久居民申请仍由加拿大移民局（IRCC）作最终决定。</p>
        <p class="en" lang="en">Ontario nominates eligible applicants whose skills and experience meet provincial needs. A provincial nomination is one stage of the process; IRCC makes the final permanent residence decision.</p>
        <p><strong>资料核实日期 | Reviewed: October 11, 2026</strong></p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/ontario-oinp-insights">查看 OINP 最新动态 | OINP Insights</a><a class="button secondary" href="/consultation?service=Ontario%20OINP">预约资格评估 | Book an Assessment</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="intro-section"><div class="container">
      <div class="section-title"><h3>当前项目状态 | Current Program Status</h3></div>
      <div class="content-box">
        <p>安省政府已推出 <strong>Ontario Workforce Priority stream（安省劳动力优先通道）</strong>，并于2026年8月4日开放意向表达（EOI）登记。该通道涵盖 NOC TEER 0–5 的合资格安省工作聘书申请人，以及符合特殊条件的自雇医生。</p>
        <p lang="en">The Ontario Workforce Priority stream is the current stream. Its EOI portal opened on August 4, 2026. It covers qualifying job offers across TEER 0–5 and eligible self-employed physicians.</p>
        <p>原 Employer Job Offer 的 Foreign Worker、International Student、In-Demand Skills，硕士毕业生、博士毕业生，以及 Express Entry 的 Human Capital Priorities、French-speaking Skilled Worker 和 Skilled Trades 八个类别已关闭，不再按旧类别发出邀请。旧类别下获邀并已提交的申请，继续按递交时适用条件审理；尚未获邀的旧 EOI 和 Job Offer 不应视为新通道登记。</p>
        <p lang="en">The eight former streams are closed. Applications submitted following an invitation under a former stream continue to be assessed under the rules in effect at submission. An old, uninvited EOI does not replace registration under the new stream.</p>
        <p>满足最低条件、登记 EOI 或获得工作聘书，都不保证收到邀请或获批。请以最新官方项目要求及邀请通知为准。</p>
        <p><a href="https://www.ontario.ca/page/2026-ontario-immigrant-nominee-program-updates">官方项目状态与过渡安排 | Official program updates →</a></p>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <section id="pathways" class="pathway-section"><div class="container">
      <div class="section-title"><h3>现行申请方向 | Current Pathways</h3><p>以下为主要条件摘要；职业例外、文件清单及完整要求请参阅官方通道页面。</p></div>
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="program-card"><span class="program-tag">Job offer · TEER 0–3</span><h4>技术职位工作聘书<br>Skilled Job Offers</h4>
          <p>需要安省合资格雇主提供全职、永久工作聘书。工作经验通常可通过以下之一满足：过去12个月在聘书职位连续工作6个月；合资格近期安省毕业生连续工作3个月；过去5年同 NOC 职业累计2年经验；或适用的强制执照／职业授权。</p>
          <p>近期安省毕业生须在过去3年毕业于官方认可安省院校，取得指定学历。NOC 73300 卡车司机和 73301 公交等司机，即使持有执照或为近期毕业生，仍须满足6个月连续经验；部分工程、护理及药房职位有指定相关职业经验规则。</p>
          <p class="zh" lang="en">Experience can be demonstrated through qualifying experience in the offered position, two years in the relevant occupation, or a mandatory licence where permitted. Recent Ontario graduates may qualify with three months in the position. Transport and transit drivers remain subject to the six-month requirement.</p>
          <p><a href="https://www.ontario.ca/page/ontario-workforce-priority-stream#work-experience">官方经验条件 | Experience requirements →</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="program-card"><span class="program-tag">Job offer · TEER 4–5</span><h4>其他职位工作聘书<br>Other Job Offers</h4>
          <p>须在过去2年内，在聘书对应职位、雇主及地点累计取得至少9个月有薪全职经验；最低语言为四项 CLB 4；学历至少为加拿大高中毕业或海外等同学历。</p>
          <p>仍须满足全职永久聘书、工资、雇主资格、合法身份及安省定居意向等要求。海外学历须按官方规定提供 ECA。</p>
          <p class="zh" lang="en">TEER 4–5 applicants need at least nine months of cumulative paid, full-time experience in the offered position within the previous two years, CLB 4 in all four abilities, and secondary school education or its equivalent. Employer and job-offer requirements also apply.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="program-card"><span class="program-tag">Language &amp; education</span><h4>语言与学历<br>Language and Education</h4>
          <p>TEER 0–3 通常要求四项 CLB 6；官方列明技工职业为 CLB 5。过去3年内取得指定安省学历的合资格毕业生，可按官方规则免语言考试。须考试者的成绩在递交时应为2年内。</p>
          <p>TEER 0–3 非指定技工职位通常要求至少一年高等教育学位／文凭或海外等同学历；指定技工通常为高中或等同学历。NOC 33102 及需强制执照的职位另有条件，司机不适用该执照学历替代安排。海外学历通常须提供递交时未满5年的 ECA。</p>
          <p class="zh" lang="en">Language and education rules depend on occupation. CLB 6 generally applies to TEER 0–3, with CLB 5 for listed trades and a qualifying recent Ontario graduate exemption. Education, licensing and ECA exceptions must be checked against the exact NOC.</p>
          <p><a href="https://www.ontario.ca/page/ontario-workforce-priority-stream#language">语言条件 | Language →</a> · <a href="https://www.ontario.ca/page/ontario-workforce-priority-stream#education">学历条件 | Education →</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="program-card"><span class="program-tag">Self-employed physicians</span><h4>自雇医生特别安排<br>Physician Pathway</h4>
          <p>符合条件的自雇医生可以没有 Job Offer。须持 OHIP billing number，具备向安省公共医疗保险收费的资格，并为 CPSO 良好信誉会员，持 independent、academic 或 provisional 类别的合资格注册证书。</p>
          <p>符合该特别安排者不适用普通雇主和其他申请人条件。Postgraduate education licence 不符合自雇医生路径条件；可另按有雇主聘书的路径评估。EOI 登记须依官方指示联系 OINP。</p>
          <p class="zh" lang="en">Eligible self-employed physicians need an OHIP billing number and qualifying CPSO registration in good standing. A postgraduate education licence does not qualify for this exception. Follow the official instructions to initiate EOI registration.</p>
          <p><a href="https://www.ontario.ca/page/ontario-workforce-priority-stream#section-4">官方自雇医生要求 | Physician requirements →</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="assessment-section"><div class="container">
      <div class="section-title"><h3>雇主与工作聘书 | Employer and Job Offer</h3></div>
      <div class="assessment-grid">
        <div class="panel"><h4>雇主资格 | Employer Eligibility</h4><ul>
          <li>通常须已实际经营至少3年，并在安省有申请人工作的营业场所。</li>
          <li>最近完整财政年度：GTA 工作地点通常须至少100万加元总营收；官方列明的 GTA 外人口较多地区通常须至少50万加元；其他地点适用最近两个完整财政年度各至少25万加元的要求。</li>
          <li>工作／报到地点的加拿大公民或永久居民全职员工：GTA 至少5人；GTA 外至少3人。</li>
          <li>须符合劳动与职业安全规定；招聘证明、司机雇主 CVOR 及安全评级等要求按具体情况核实。</li>
        </ul><p lang="en">Eligibility depends on active operations, Ontario premises, location-specific revenue and staffing, compliance and applicable recruitment requirements. Use the employer guide to determine the correct location category and evidence.</p></div>
        <div class="panel"><h4>职位与工资 | Position and Wage</h4><ul>
          <li>永久职位须无结束日期；全职为每周至少30小时有薪工作、每年至少1,560小时；季节性或合同制聘书不符合要求。</li>
          <li>通常须达到工作地区相应职业的中位工资；TEER 0–3 合资格近期安省毕业生可适用低位工资标准。集体协议职位有特别规则。</li>
          <li>如已在该职位工作，聘书工资不得低于现有工资，且仍须满足适用标准。</li>
          <li>职位须为雇主业务急需，并不得影响劳动争议。提名后的工作条件变化须按规定报告。</li>
        </ul><p lang="en">The offer must be permanent and full-time, necessary to the business, and meet the applicable regional wage standard. Existing employees must also retain at least their current wage. Nomination conditions continue after approval.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="highlight-box"><h3>身份与定居意向 | Status and Settlement Intention</h3><p>从加拿大境内申请须有合法身份；符合规定的 maintained status 可申请。省提名本身不会自动延长工签或赋予工作权。须证明在获永久居民身份后计划在安省居住及工作。</p><p lang="en">Applicants in Canada must meet legal-status requirements and demonstrate an intention to live and work in Ontario. Provincial nomination does not itself extend a work permit or create work authorization.</p><a href="https://www.ontario.ca/page/oinp-employer-job-offer-streams-employer-guide">雇主完整要求 | Official employer guide →</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="intro-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-title"><h3>申请流程 | Application Process</h3></div><div class="content-box">
      <ol>
        <li><strong>雇主先启动：</strong>雇主在 Employer Portal 登记并提交 Job Offer，取得 Job Offer ID。<span lang="en">The employer initiates the process and provides a job offer ID.</span></li>
        <li><strong>登记 EOI：</strong>申请人须在雇主提交 Job Offer 后30个日历日内登记；评分须有可核实证明。<span lang="en">Register within 30 calendar days of the employer's job-offer submission.</span></li>
        <li><strong>获邀后递交：</strong>雇主须在邀请发出后14个日历日内提交职位审批申请；申请人须在17个日历日内提交申请及付款，并在雇主递交后才能最终提交。<span lang="en">After invitation, the employer has 14 calendar days and the applicant has 17; the employer submits first.</span></li>
        <li><strong>获提名后：</strong>按提名条件维持获批职位及身份，并在规定期限内向 IRCC 申请永久居民。<span lang="en">After nomination, comply with nomination conditions and apply to IRCC by the required deadline.</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p>EOI 评分与最低申请条件是两回事。职位、工资、经验、学历、语言、身份及工作地区等可能影响分数；请直接查看官方评分表。TEER 0–3 及自雇医生符合联邦 Express Entry 资格并维持有效档案时，可依官方规则选择 Express Entry 提名；这不代表原 Express Entry 类别重新开放。</p>
      <p lang="en">EOI points do not replace eligibility requirements. A qualifying TEER 0–3 applicant or self-employed physician may request nomination through Express Entry if federal eligibility and valid-profile requirements are met. This does not reopen the former Express Entry streams.</p>
      <p><a href="https://www.ontario.ca/page/ontario-workforce-priority-stream#section-3">官方申请步骤 | Application steps →</a> · <a href="https://www.ontario.ca/page/ontario-workforce-priority-stream#section-5">官方评分表 | EOI scoring →</a></p>
    </div></div></section>

